       ("How to submit", "<p>Google says you can use an XML file, a tab-delimited file or a Google Spreadsheet, uploaded to the same Merchant Center account as your product data.</p>"),
       ("Promotion ID", "<p>The promotion ID is required, up to 50 characters, case-sensitive and without spaces or symbols such as % and !. It links a promotion to products.</p>"),
